{
  "about": "paradox-validator --changed: which suites a changed file needs. core always runs. A file matching everything, or a file no area claims, runs every suite. A changed suite file runs itself. Patterns: dir/ is everything under dir, * stays inside one path part, ** crosses parts. When several areas claim a file, the most specific pattern wins (astrix-app/pages/aetherium/ beats astrix-app/pages/); areas tied on the same pattern length all run. astrix-app/module-versions.json is not in everything: its diff is read and each module it bumps picks the areas that own that module path; a change to its format, or to build-module-versions.mjs, runs every suite. Each suite must sit in core or at least one area (test-paradox-validator-runner.mjs checks it).",
